1 0 0 1 46 389 Tm (26. Final Conclusion) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 339 Tm (The Reetrak Automation project is a well-structured Selenium TestNG framework designed to) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 324 Tm (automate authentication-related validation for the Reetrak web application. It already) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 309 Tm (includes strong foundational practices such as Page Object Model design, centralized driver) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 294 Tm (setup, externalized configuration, evidence capture, and custom reporting.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 267 Tm (This framework should be used whenever browser-level validation of login and logout flows is) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 252 Tm (needed. It should be extended by adding well-structured page objects and test classes. It) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 237 Tm (should be maintained by updating locators, configuration, and dependencies in their proper) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 222 Tm (layers instead of mixing concerns.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 195 Tm (Most importantly, the framework is not only useful for current login coverage. It is also a) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 180 Tm (scalable starting point for future UI automation across the wider application. With) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 165 Tm (continued improvement in waits, configuration security, suite organization, and reporting) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 150 Tm (maturity, it can evolve into a strong enterprise-grade automation foundation without) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
1 0 0 1 46 135 Tm (changing its core design philosophy.) Tj
ET
